Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:26.22,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}徹夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:28.34,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明亮的月光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.35,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}奪目的藍光
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.77,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}霓虹燈喚醒了內心的表裡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:34.77,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}徹夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.77,0:21:36.69,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}把我們帶進深夜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.85,0:21:38.60,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}饞涎欲垂的赤瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.77,0:21:41.69,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人們的搖籃曲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:43.90,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我從兒時就喜歡夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.90,0:21:45.95,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不知為何不喜歡在九點睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.95,0:21:48.07,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}就是感覺很可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:50.20,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}想要更深入地了解你
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.74,0:21:52.49,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}也就是所謂的佔小便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.49,0:21:55.41,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}即使虧本也想繼續深入地了解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.41,0:21:56.71,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}了解的徹徹底底
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:21:58.92,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}從12點一直到丑時
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.00,0:22:00.88,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}第一次橫跨是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:03.67,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}不對  第一次橫跨是在14歲的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.75,0:22:05.34,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我是什麼也不懂的wannabe
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.34,0:22:07.42,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}一切都對我來說是新鮮的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.42,0:22:08.51,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你的姿態和氣味
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.51,0:22:11.26,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}被你那融入寂靜的黑色肌膚
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.89,0:22:14.77,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}所吸引  無法抵抗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:17.89,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}然後你給我推薦了音樂
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.89,0:22:19.73,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}也給我看了女人的赤裸
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.81,0:22:22.06,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}第一次喝了酒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:24.11,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}點了從爸爸那裡偷的煙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.23,0:22:25.57,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}幹了太多不能幹的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:27.57,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}知道了不該知道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.11,0:22:29.82,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}我被迎來的黑夜所吞噬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.86,0:22:31.45,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}你卻一直很隨心所欲
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.45,0:22:33.28,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}徹夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.28,0:22:35.37,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}明亮的月光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:37.20,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}奪目的藍光
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:39.46,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}霓虹燈喚醒了內心的表裡
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.46,0:22:41.58,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}徹夜之歌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.58,0:22:43.46,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}把我們帶進深夜
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.46,0:22:45.71,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}饞涎欲垂的赤瞳
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.71,0:22:48.47,EDCN-CHT,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\be3}大人們的搖籃曲
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Title——
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.91,0:15:00.92,Title,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(968,680)}第6夜:開心的不好嗎
Comment: 0,0:00:01.02,0:00:01.02,Comment,,0,0,0,,——Text——
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.19,0:00:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,之前有醉鬼落了東西…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你讓我在這裡下車吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.61,0:00:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你到家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不用了  我有別的地方要去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.57,0:00:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,累了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.92,0:00:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,公司的酒會
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.71,0:00:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,不好的地方是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:30.63,Default,,0,0,0,,很晚才能回家
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.13,0:00:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至不如在公司工作
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.51,0:00:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,說什麼「這應該不是性騷擾吧」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.51,0:00:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,還說要送我回家  誰要你送啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.61,0:00:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,能感受到這種靜寂算是酒會的好處吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.36,0:00:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那邊…還開著嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.20,0:01:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,睡不著嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.88,0:01:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,聲音大一點也可以哦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:16.55,Comment,,0,0,0,,這裡…這裡好!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,去解解乏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.23,0:01:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,請進
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.78,0:01:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,如果幫我做了的話  我再親你一口怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.16,0:01:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好慢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.67,0:01:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,開始吧  按摩套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.92,0:01:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,讓我等了這麼久
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:01:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,而且變得這麼古怪!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,非常…不放心…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.77,0:03:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,可以說絕對不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,並不是想要小薺親我才當陪睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.91,0:03:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,痛嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.74,0:03:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不痛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.79,0:03:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,再用力一點也可以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.79,0:03:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:58.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我都使很大力氣按了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.13,0:04:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,關於光君的報酬…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,4000日元的一半
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.51,0:04:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,2000日元怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.09,0:04:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,工資給2000日元很吸引人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.39,0:04:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因為是筆巨款
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.22,0:04:14.69,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟讓小薺承擔所有玩的開銷  有點過意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要的是錢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.23,0:04:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,絕不是齷齪的想讓她親我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.11,0:04:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,才幫她陪睡的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.20,0:04:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,小薺估計是誤會了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:29.45,Comment,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟她既不檢點又厚臉皮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.66,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真讓人傷腦筋
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.75,0:04:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,也許會冒犯你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.63,0:04:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,您看起來很年輕
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,您今年多大?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,十四歲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,您可以起來一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來是…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.69,0:04:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼  十四?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,國中生?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.03,0:05:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  已經國二了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,國二…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.28,0:05:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我國中的時候可沒有打過工
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.12,0:05:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是今天才開始的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.08,0:05:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是有什麼不好說的隱情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺不應該說剛才那一句
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.84,0:05:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你為什麼要打工啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.84,0:05:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,要說為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.43,0:05:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,想要錢?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.47,0:05:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,不是親吻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.89,0:05:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,果然是不太好說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,之後嘛…對
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.02,0:05:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,有想做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.77,0:05:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,想做的事是指?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:49.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我因為不去學校  不怎麼活動
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,就睡不著了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道怎麼想的  第一次半夜獨自一人出門
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼講呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然是每天都走的路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,只因為是晚上  就感到很興奮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.34,0:06:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想失去這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.68,0:06:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,想要享受夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.14,0:06:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道我表達得對不對
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.10,0:06:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,就是這種感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,這邊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不是市中心  車不多
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.03,0:06:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,比如在馬路中間散散步…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.78,0:06:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,對對  就感覺很自由
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.20,0:06:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,再比如大聲唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,然後發現附近有人就很害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.13,0:06:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,當我在你這個年紀時  也是這麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.09,0:06:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,已經是十年前了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.72,0:06:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次在晚上出門
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,在便利店買了肉包子和茶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.35,0:07:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,這個地方只屬於我的感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.94,0:07:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,已經忘記很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那個  我的名字是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,小…店長跟我說了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.74,0:07:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,白河小姐  對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫夜守光
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.95,0:07:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你為什麼不去學校呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.79,0:07:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,因為覺得很無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,接下來伸出您的小手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.50,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小手…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,別看我現在這樣  我還算是個優等生來著
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.51,0:07:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,就是…感覺累到了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,優等生在晚上淪落成現在這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.69,0:07:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我也有點累了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.86,0:07:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,所以來這家陪睡店了?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.86,0:07:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我很享受工作本身
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.40,0:07:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是工作必須跟其他人打交道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:07:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,衝啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.49,0:08:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,比如跟上司  同事
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,要一直保持開心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.21,0:08:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,還得陪別人笑…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.05,0:08:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.55,0:08:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,早就忘記了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了了!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.56,0:08:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,公司和酒會我都不想去啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,來電
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.65,0:08:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,經理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,是上司
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我得回公司
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他總是在這個時候叫我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不去的話會被罵的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.21,0:08:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,今天就這樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,就這麼讓她走了  真的好嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟她自己說要去…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.89,0:09:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,話說現在讓她走了的話我就拿不到工資了…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.60,0:09:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不對  這不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.23,0:09:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.94,0:09:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這個人是我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.82,0:09:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,和我一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,夜守  你能走開一下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不行  不能讓你走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.91,0:09:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你必須給我在這裡睡覺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.79,0:09:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,按摩還沒結束
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,必須讓你熬夜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小薺
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.34,0:09:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你靠著門幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我有事要拜託你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.43,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,別讓她…去公司!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.60,0:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,別問了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.77,0:09:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.02,0:09:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,讓她去不了公司就行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.65,0:09:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,開窗戶  光君
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.40,0:09:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,走你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:09:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,扔出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:09:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,太隨意了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.67,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我要死了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,這是要死了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.67,0:10:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你不會死的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.69,0:10:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,是的  不會死
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嚇得我沒有力氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,沒事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定有事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.32,0:10:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,清澄小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.99,0:10:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,很抱歉剛才對你很粗暴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.33,0:10:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我認為無論如何也不能讓你離開
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我不想讓你離開
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.59,0:10:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.88,0:10:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你哭了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:11:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,既然這麼討厭就不要做了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你還是孩子所以不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,這是工作  是公司
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,和學校不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.94,0:11:13.52,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\an7\fs35\bord1.5\c&H6D6D6D&\3c&HFFFEFC&}緊急!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.15,0:11:18.11,Comment,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正兰亭黑_GBK\an7\fs35\bord1.5\c&H6D6D6D&\3c&HFFFEFC&}緊急!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,上司叫我的話  我就必須得去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的大人即使想哭也得承受
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.41,0:11:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  那種事情…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,小薺
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我想變成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.79,0:11:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.25,0:11:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,小薺是吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.46,0:11:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我想讓她把我變成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你至少能看出來她不是人類吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,正如你所說  我是個小孩
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.80,0:11:48.93,Default,,0,0,0,,對公司和社會一無所知
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.81,0:11:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我很天真
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,又不正經
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可是在這個時間叫你的上司更不正經
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.98,0:12:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,現在可是早上兩點
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.53,0:12:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果都不正經  那選開心的不好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.03,0:12:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而且吸血鬼不需要很正經
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.41,0:12:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟不是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,太荒唐了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他想成為吸血鬼是因為想享受夜晚
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:24.72,Default,,0,0,0,,不過…好羨慕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.64,0:12:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,這話說得
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.64,0:12:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你為什麼在笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.23,0:12:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟…你想成為吸血鬼的理由…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.15,0:12:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,也太荒謬了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.61,0:12:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟我說過了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.49,0:12:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,能在馬路中間散步
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.21,0:12:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,這太上癮了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我記得是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,越不讓做的事情  不知道為什麼就越開心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,一定是你也不正經
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.77,0:13:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你可真敢說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.11,0:13:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不過我不能一直這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我是大人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我還是去公司吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.46,0:13:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟是規定
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.17,0:13:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而且你已經讓我很放鬆了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,祝願你能變成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.22,0:13:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,真好啊  我也…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.85,0:13:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,白河小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我能變成吸血鬼的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我就把你也變成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,隨時都能放棄人類身份
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.74,0:14:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,如果能這麼想  心情更舒暢吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你說話說得這麼果斷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.63,0:14:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,啊  為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.55,0:14:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,首先你都不知道自己能否變成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.43,0:14:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你想讓她變成你的眷屬的話得…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.14,0:14:42.48,Comment,,0,0,0,,她得愛上我  對吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不要說「愛上我」這種話啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.77,0:14:47.44,Comment,,0,0,0,,沒事  畢竟我還是挺受歡迎的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,呃…好噁心…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.92,0:15:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,晚上…好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.17,0:15:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  想一個好玩的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你看起來像一個有權利的惡人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.59,0:15:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,偶爾你也想一想嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,每天都一樣  你不膩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,去唱歌?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.60,0:15:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然我現在不想去唱歌  但是就是這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.27,0:15:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,看電影?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.60,0:15:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,電影啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.27,0:15:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,遊戲廳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.31,0:15:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不錯  但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.90,0:15:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,飛鏢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,滑板
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.03,0:15:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你沒滑過吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.57,0:15:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,變魔術
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我說啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.57,0:15:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,夜…夜間泳池呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.45,0:15:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,夜間泳池  你認真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.00,0:15:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨炸了吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.00,0:15:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,小薺變成派對狂了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.38,0:15:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,原來光君是天才陽光男孩!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎  太好了!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我等不及了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,快打扮的漂漂亮亮的趕過去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.01,0:15:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我只有這身外套啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一個感想是「原來夜間泳池真的是這樣的」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.28,0:16:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我想起來我沒有任何泳裝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,不過店裡有借給我的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,原來有這樣的夜晚和夜生活
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.46,0:16:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是大人的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.79,0:16:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,明明都是泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是跟學校的不一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有一種奇特的氛圍…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.68,0:16:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,小薺穿的什麼泳裝
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.31,0:16:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我有點期待…吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不過她平常衣服裡面穿的就是泳裝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺虧了點什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,喲  讓你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.41,0:16:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,喲  你怎麼無精打采的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.08,0:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,這算什麼泳裝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.41,0:17:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,在裡面穿了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.17,0:17:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拿點喝的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,這裡還能喝酒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.13,0:17:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.64,0:17:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,講道理比平常露的還少
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,卻感覺…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼比平常還刺激?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.31,0:17:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你看  那個人太好看了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,真的呀  太好看了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.53,0:17:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真的有長得像娃娃一樣的人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.20,0:17:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她就一個人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.11,0:17:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.95,0:17:42.33,Comment,,0,0,0,,服務員  來一杯啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,小薺果然是很好看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她之前雖然說過吸血鬼長得都好看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,但是總感覺心裡有個疙瘩…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有好多人在說話…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.93,0:18:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,喲  小姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.14,0:18:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,一個人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.10,0:18:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你好好看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我也感覺
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.94,0:18:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,在…在搭訕!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.81,0:18:10.98,Comment,,0,0,0,,你從哪裡來的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.02,0:18:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,原來真的有人會搭訕!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:12.02,Comment,,0,0,0,,現在幾歲了?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,搭訕是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.61,0:18:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,不  我跟人一起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.28,0:18:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.41,0:18:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真掃興
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.99,0:18:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,恭平你一定可以的!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.33,0:18:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,一起來玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.75,0:18:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不過你請我喝的話  倒是可以考慮一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.71,0:18:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.84,0:18:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你來的人呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道  可能走了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼可能這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.13,0:18:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,不過我們平時很懶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.18,0:18:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,從來不搭訕的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.06,0:18:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,對對對
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.89,0:18:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她在想什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.23,0:18:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在搞什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.10,0:18:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說我想跟你做個朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.54,0:19:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,對不住啊  他沒走
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.13,0:19:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是有人跟她來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,別讓女孩自己一個人走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.55,0:19:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,加油  少年
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.89,0:19:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,喂  別生氣了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.06,0:19:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是開了個玩笑而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,光君!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,夜間泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.57,0:19:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,只是有很多人  並不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.53,0:19:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,聽別人對你的評價很無聊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.50,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,人多讓我也感到很累
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,看到別人想跟你做朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺有點…難受
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,光君
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.14,0:20:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,要不我們再去泳池?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.69,0:20:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我就算了…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.19,0:20:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,別咬到舌頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼回事  我好害怕!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.28,0:20:24.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你快看
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.49,0:20:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,是泳池
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是我們學校的泳池嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,嚇死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.64,0:20:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不過很有意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.90,0:20:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,光君  對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我又捉弄你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.70,0:21:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是…不在意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我是怎麼想的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.75,0:21:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,問小薺的話  她會告訴我嗎
Comment: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:01.00,Comment,,0,0,0,,
